{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"模形式"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“模形式”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>模形式是"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"椭圆曲线的模叠"}},{"Plain":"上的某种微分形式.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>记 $\\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"椭圆曲线的模叠"}},{"Plain":", $A \\to \\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ 为万有椭圆曲线, $\\Omega^1_{A/S}$ 为其上的逐纤维 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler微分","text":"Kähler 微分"}},{"Plain":", $e$ 为零截面. 考虑 $\\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ 上的线丛\n$$\r\n\\omega:=e^*\\Omega^1_{A/S}.\r\n$$\n$k$ 阶模形式是 $\\omega^{\\otimes k}$ 的截面.</p>\n<h2>相关页面</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"谷山–志村猜想","text":"谷山–志村猜想"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}